(7216154, 1111973, 138253, '<td valign="top">i''ve ended up with this on my screen for several minutes as a result of software installs happening on computers here in the lab at work...i keep looking back and find myself unsure how to comment adequately. i Like this image, but i don''t know how much i LIKE this image. It''s the two whatever-they-are in the front (breakwalls?). I can''t determine if i like them or not. the image feels incomplete without them, but it''s all my brain wants to acknowledge when looking at the image otherwise, and i don''t like that it''s taking my focus away from the lighthouse.<br/>i''d give this a 7.5 if that was an option, but as it''s not you get rounded up to an 8 :)</td>', 'i''ve ended up with this on my screen for several minutes as a result of software installs happening on computers here in the lab at work...i keep looking back and find myself unsure how to comment adequately. i Like this image, but i don''t know how much i LIKE this image. It''s the two whatever-they-are in the front (breakwalls?). I can''t determine if i like them or not. the image feels incomplete without them, but it''s all my brain wants to acknowledge when looking at the image otherwise, and i don''t like that it''s taking my focus away from the lighthouse.i''d give this a 7.5 if that was an option, but as it''s not you get rounded up to an 8 :)', '2014-05-13 14:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
