(7216167, 1111600, 138253, '<td valign="top">i''m not quite sure what i think with this image, it''s simple and accurate, it''s unassuming but still manages to grab your eyes and demand attention. i think the "infinitely black background" is what''s giving me pause here, we have a (until very recently) healthy specimen, radiating out to the world with everything it has, enticing you in, but then floating in oblivion.<br/>one may make correlations to the meaning of life or planets floating in space, butfor me it''s just very stark and seems out of place.<br/>i want to give this more (and i may come back to do so after finishing), but i''m going to give this a 6 for now.</td>', 'i''m not quite sure what i think with this image, it''s simple and accurate, it''s unassuming but still manages to grab your eyes and demand attention. i think the "infinitely black background" is what''s giving me pause here, we have a (until very recently) healthy specimen, radiating out to the world with everything it has, enticing you in, but then floating in oblivion.one may make correlations to the meaning of life or planets floating in space, butfor me it''s just very stark and seems out of place.i want to give this more (and i may come back to do so after finishing), but i''m going to give this a 6 for now.', '2014-05-13 14:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
